Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:01:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): order materialized parents ahead of dependent
 retries [daveey]

Review6005624020: one synthetic-parent refusal inserted a task at the FIFO tail; global synthesis suppression then sent child,parent forever against a healthy Board. Keep existing parent ownership and immutable uncertain identities, but promote that queued parent and hold dependents through backoff/quarantine and pre-head filtering. Apply limits after filtering so unrelated cards progress. Independent probes reproduce 4 failures/8 passes on66bf8e and12/12 pass after. Additional dependency and containment rekey controls pass;832 consumer tests and21 package checks pass. Full CI and exact-head review remain required; final-collection replay remains OPEN.
